         SharedProjectPublishTargetListResult/SharedProjectPublishResource/SharedProjectPublishDefinition/
         SharedProjectPublishResult (new types). Turns a not-yet-shared local project into a new portable definition
         at a source-chosen target, the missing "publish" mirror of PrepareBindingAsync's "attach" — the naad AC-242's
         own outbound direction never had one for. Major and abstractionsVersion stay 1. Consumed in-repo by
         Cockpit.Plugin.Depot, whose minHostVersion moves with it. -->
    <!-- 1.52.0 (AC-715): added the IPluginSessionDriver.RespondToPermissionAsync overload that also carries the
         operator's answers — a clarifying-question tool (Claude's AskUserQuestion, which Kimi tunnels over ACP under
         the same name) rides the permission callback but asks for an answer, and allow/deny alone approves the
